&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1483&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a362eabefef3&quot;&gt;Proven experience leading technical projects or engineering teams, ideally in infrastructure, cloud, or datacenter environments&lt;/p&gt;
