&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is also behind a growing family of digital healthcare clinics (&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://pilot.com.au/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id--497002263&quot;&gt;Pilot,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://www.kinfertility.com.au/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id--741940253&quot;&gt;Kin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://skin.software/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-680441545&quot;&gt;Software&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;https://www.compound.co/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id--544211386&quot;&gt;Compound&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;) across men’s health and well-being, fertility, skincare, and preventative health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here’s what makes joining Euc unique:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s next&lt;/strong&gt; - Our goal for the next three years is to support &lt;strong&gt;1 million patients globally&lt;/strong&gt; to live better for longer. We’re launching into new conditions, demographics, and geographies as we build a truly preventive healthcare ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build something world-changing&lt;/strong&gt; - We’re on the path to becoming the world’s largest international digital healthcare company. It will be challenging, fast-paced, and deeply rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact&lt;/strong&gt; - You will deliver work that directly shapes patient outcomes and scales evidence-based care across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate your growth&lt;/strong&gt; - You will have high ownership, continuous feedback, and dedicated development support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a motivated team&lt;/strong&gt; - You will collaborate with talented peers to solve complex clinical and operational problems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What’s ahead in the UK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be an owner&lt;/strong&gt; – Your own stake in the business with our employee options program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in your growth&lt;/strong&gt; – Annual development budget plus 3 days of professional development leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work flexibly&lt;/strong&gt; – Hybrid setup with 3 days a week in our Old Street office, designed for focus and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your well-being&lt;/strong&gt; – Private health insurance through Vitality or opt for a monthly wellness allowance to spend on what matters most to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take time off&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days of holiday, enhanced parental leave and work from anywhere 3 weeks out of the year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join a connected team&lt;/strong&gt; – A vibrant office culture with regular socials, clubs, after-school sport, and seasonal events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Via is on a mission to create public transportation systems that provide far greater access to jobs, healthcare, and education. Our platform serves as the technology backbone for modern transit networks, transforming antiquated and siloed public transportation systems into smart, data-driven, and efficient digital networks. With hundreds of agency partners around the world, Via is recognized as the leading transportation technology and service provider globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Finance Principal&lt;/strong&gt; at Via, you will lead high-priority financial projects to drive rapid growth, guide corporate strategy and create long-term value. You’ll own critical financial work streams from start to finish, partnering directly with our executive leadership and cross-functional Sales, Product and Operations teams to manage risks and capture new business opportunities. Joining this high-impact team puts you at the heart of Via’s global scaling efforts, where your financial modeling and strategic insights will influence company-wide decision making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive global revenue strategy, including pricing structuring, go-to-market optimization, and incentive alignment across all product segments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support high stakes deal negotiations through the development of rigorous financial modeling, acting as a strategic thought partner to the Partnerships, Growth, and Operations teams to streamline business processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on corporate and business development initiatives, including financings, M&amp;amp;A opportunities, and strategic partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and refine KPIs that guide leadership and support business-wide decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop executive-ready materials for board meetings, investor updates, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 6+ years of experience in private equity, investment banking, management consulting, transaction services or in strategic finance / corporate finance / FP&amp;amp;A&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter with excellent judgment, strong business intuition, and a bias for action&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast-moving and responsive; you thrive in a dynamic environment and consistently deliver high-quality work on tight timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional Excel and financial modeling skills with a knack for robust simplicity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills; you’re able to both crunch numbers and discuss your analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sophisticated understanding of corporate finance and accounting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative and solutions-oriented; you’re able to think on your feet when presented with a tough problem and willing to develop new approaches to challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful, a problem solver who is motivated by high levels of ownership and the opportunity to have a measurable impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final salary will be determined by the candidate’s experience, knowledge, and skills. Salary reflected does not include equity or variable pay, where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary Range [For NYC based role]: $125,000-$165,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are proud to offer a generous and comprehensive benefits package, including free medical plans, 401K matching, catered lunch on Wednesdays, and many other perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There has never been a more exciting time to be on the cutting edge of public mobility. Ready to join the ride?&lt;/p&gt;
